<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CoffeeChat AI - 부드러운 UI 에디션</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN 로드 -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts Import: 고운 돋움 (둥글둥글한 느낌) -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Gowun+Dodum&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        /* 커스텀 변수 정의 - 색상 악센트를 더 세련된 카라멜 톤으로 변경 */
        :root {
            --color-light-bg: #F8F7F3; /* 기본 배경: 매우 밝은 아이보리/베이지 */
            --color-cream: #FFFFFF; /* 섹션 배경: 깨끗한 화이트 */
            --color-text-dark: #4A352D; /* 텍스트: 다크 코코아 (가독성 유지) */
            --color-accent-vibrant: #CC9966; /* 메인 액센트: 따뜻하고 깊은 카라멜 브라운 */
            --color-accent-soft: #D4C3A3; /* 서브 악센트: 부드러운 샌드/라이트 우드 */
            
            /* 폰트 변경: Gowun Dodum으로 통일 */
            --font-main: 'Gowun Dodum', sans-serif;
        }

        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */
        /* Global / Layout Reset */
        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */

        .main-container {
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
            background-color: var(--color-light-bg);
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .content-wrapper {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */
        /* Typography & Decoratives */
        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */

        h1, h2, h3, h4 { 
            font-family: var(--font-main); 
            font-weight: 700; 
        } 
        
        /* H1 스타일 */
        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem; 
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .h1-line-spacing {
            line-height: 1.5; /* 요청하신 줄 간격 */
        }

        .emoji-accent {
            font-size: 3.5rem; 
            color: var(--color-accent-vibrant);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-text h1, .emoji-accent { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .hero-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .hero-text {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
        }

        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.125rem; 
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            max-width: 560px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        /* Vintage Divider */
        .vintage-divider {
            width: 100px;
            height: 2px;
            background-color: var(--color-accent-soft);
            opacity: 0.8;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Badge */
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: var(--color-cream);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 12px; 
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .badge .icon { 
            color: var(--color-accent-vibrant); 
        }

        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */
        /* Buttons */
        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 48px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; width: 100%; }
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--color-accent-soft);
            font-family: var(--font-main);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--color-accent-vibrant);
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-vibrant);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translate(0, 0);
            background: #DDAA66;
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--color-accent-soft);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            border: 2px solid var(--color-accent-vibrant);
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
            background: var(--color-cream);
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--color-accent-vibrant);
            color: white;
            background: var(--color-accent-vibrant);
        }

        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */
        /* Sections Layout */
        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */

        .hero-section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            background-color: var(--color-light-bg);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .steps-section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            background-color: var(--color-cream);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
        }
        
        .steps-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 32px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .steps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }


        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */
        /* Component Specific Styles */
        /* ---------------------------------------------------- */

        /* Hero Image */
        .hero-image-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .image-frame-border {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            border: 4px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
            border-radius: 12px;
            transform: rotate(-1deg);
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }
        .hero-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 450px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
            filter: brightness(1.05) contrast(1.0);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 20;
        }
        
        /* Steps */
        .step-card {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px;
            background-color: var(--color-light-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .step-icon {
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            border: 3px solid var(--color-accent-vibrant);
            box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--color-accent-soft);
            background-color: var(--color-cream);
        }

        /* Footer */
        .main-footer {
            background-color: var(--color-cream);
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
            padding: 60px 0 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
        }
        .footer-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
        }
        .contact-list li { 
            display: flex; 
            gap: 8px; 
            align-items: center; 
            font-size: 0.9rem; 
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
        }
        .footer-bottom {
            padding-top: 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--color-text-dark);
        }
        .bottom-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="main-container">
    <div class="min-h-screen">
        
        <!-- 1. Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="content-wrapper hero-grid">
                
                <!-- Hero Text -->
                <div class="hero-text">
                    
                    <div class="badge">
                        <span class="icon">☕</span>
                        <span>AI 바리스타의 오늘의 추천 블렌딩</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- H1: 간격 조정 클래스 적용 및 이모티콘 변경 -->
                    <h1 class="h1-line-spacing">
                        햇살 가득한 공간에서,<br />
                        당신의 성장을 블렌딩하세요 
                        <span class="emoji-accent">💬💖</span>
                    </h1>
                    
                    <div class="vintage-divider"></div>

                    <!-- 설명 텍스트 -->
                    <p class="hero-description">
                        AI 바리스타가 당신의 커리어 목표와 성장 취향을 분석하여<br />
                        가장 완벽한 '커피챗' 레시피를 만들어 드립니다. 
                    </p>

                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <!-- Vue router-link를 일반 a 태그로 교체 -->
                        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <span>💬</span> 바리스타에게 주문하기
                        </a>
                        <a href="/network?tab=list" class="btn btn-outline">
                            오늘의 메뉴판 둘러보기 <span>▶</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Image -->
                <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
                    <div class="image-frame-border"></div>
                    <img
                        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517048676732-d65bc937f952?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D"
                        alt="Coffee chat meeting scene"
                        class="hero-image"
                        onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://placehold.co/800x450/D4C3A3/4A352D?text=CoffeeChat+Scene';"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. Steps Section (AI 바리스타의 추천 블렌딩) -->
        <section id="how-it-works" class="steps-section">
            <div class="content-wrapper">
                <div class="section-header text-center mb-12">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[--color-text-dark] mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest">AI 바리스타의 추천 블렌딩 레시피</h2>
                    <div class="vintage-divider mx-auto my-4"></div>
                    <p class="text-[--color-text-dark] italic text-base">✨ 최고의 커피챗 경험을 위한 3단계 레시피 ✨</p>
                </div>

                <div class="steps-grid">
                    
                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-icon">
                            <span>📝</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[--color-text-dark]">원두 선택 (프로필)</h3>
                        <p class="text-[--color-text-dark] text-base">당신의 커리어 취향과 목표를 알려주세요</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-icon">
                            <span>💡</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[--color-text-dark]">최적의 레시피 블렌딩</h3>
                        <p class="text-[--color-text-dark] text-base">AI가 가장 잘 맞는 멘토를 추출해 드립니다</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="step-card">
                        <div class="step-icon">
                            <span>🫂</span>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-[--color-text-dark]">따뜻한 한 잔의 대화</h3>
                        <p class="text-[--color-text-dark] text-base">멘토와 만나 성장의 향을 음미하세요</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. Footer (밝은 톤과 부드러운 색상 유지) -->
        <footer class="main-footer">
            <div class="content-wrapper">
                <div class="footer-grid">
                    
                    <!-- Brand -->
                    <div class="footer-brand">
                        <div class="brand-title">CoffeeChat AI</div>
                        <div class="brand-slogan">Connect. Share. Grow.</div>
                        <p class="brand-desc">
                            AI 기반 스마트 매칭으로 당신의 성장을 돕는 커피챗 플랫폼
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Service Links -->
                    <div class="footer-links">
                        <h4>서비스</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li><a href="#mentors">멘토 찾기</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">멘토 지원하기</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">AI 매칭</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#how-it-works">이용 가이드</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Company Links -->
                    <div class="footer-links">
                        <h4>회사</h4>
                        <ul>
                            <li><a href="#">회사 소개</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">채용</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">블로그</a></li>
                            <li><a href="#">공지사항</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Contact -->
                    <div class="footer-links">
                        <h4>문의</h4>
                        <ul class="contact-list">
                            <li><span>✉️</span> coffeechat@pknu.ai</li>
                            <li><span>📞</span> 051-000-0000</li>
                            <li><span>📍</span> 부경대학교 스마트 아카데미 5조</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Footer Bottom -->
                <div class="footer-bottom">
                    <p>© 2025 CoffeeChat AI. All rights reserved.</p>
                    <div class="bottom-links">
                        <a href="#">이용약관</a>
                        <a href="#">개인정보처리방침</a>
                        <a href="#">FAQ</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>